WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Four compatible tires, a $150 budget and a three-day lead time. All products, stock and fitment records are fictional.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
SQL enforces compatibility and fresh stock, then ranks eligible products. Product cards expose prices, locations and factor scores.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The selected store has no stock in this request. Compatible alternatives come from another location within the retailer's assigned scope.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
A follow-up changes the comfort priority and budget before querying. The session revision and resulting options record that transition.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
The local observation is two hours old and is excluded. Returned stock is fresh; query timing and score contributions are measured evidence.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
The local demo runs on FastAPI and SQLite. Snowflake and Azure need configuration. Explore the source, diagrams, decisions and evaluation.
